{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/captura0.png?t=1726241200\" /><br><strong>Devotion, betrayal, vengeance, and redemption.</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/ec4948ed7d9df8b150e03004dbeb8314__1___1_.gif?t=1726241200\" /><br>Uncover the dark secrets of &quot;The Order&quot; to achieve divine redemption.<br>A Souls-like game with an isometric view.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/captura5.jpg?t=1726241200\" /><br>Help Cedric find redemption. Use your melee or ranged attacks, increase your magical powers, and solve puzzles to access certain areas. Immerse yourself in the underworld and defeat the evil one.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/captura1.jpg?t=1726241200\" /><br>Explore the world of Ironholt, delve into the depths of Sombracave, or face the defenders of the various fortresses condemned by the evil one.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/captura2.jpg?t=1726241200\" /><br>Choose your attack style wisely\u2014melee, ranged, or magic\u2014each enemy has its weaknesses.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/captura3.jpg?t=1726241200\" /><br>Investigate your enemies, seek information about their pacts with the evil one and the curse they bear. Gather all the treatises to gain the power to confront the lord of evil.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/captura4.jpg?t=1726241200\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/quest.gif?t=1726241200\" /><br>Buy, sell, or try your luck at gambling to earn enough money to get potions or magic cards\u2014any help in Ironholt is little enough.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3095630?t=1726241200","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1726241200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/e43232f4fb5ce217d6ea6bed65385e7bfb2ba7ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726241200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/e43232f4fb5ce217d6ea6bed65385e7bfb2ba7ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726241200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/captura0.png?t=1726241200\" /><br><strong>Devotion, betrayal, vengeance, and redemption.</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/ec4948ed7d9df8b150e03004dbeb8314__1___1_.gif?t=1726241200\" /><br>Uncover the dark secrets of &quot;The Order&quot; to achieve divine redemption.<br>A Souls-like game with an isometric view.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/captura5.jpg?t=1726241200\" /><br>Help Cedric find redemption. Use your melee or ranged attacks, increase your magical powers, and solve puzzles to access certain areas. Immerse yourself in the underworld and defeat the evil one.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095630/extras/captura1.jpg?t=1726241200\" /><br>Explore the world of Ironholt, delve i